[gd_scene load_steps=4 format=3 uid="uid://unittilemaplayerscenetilecontroloddgrid"]

; The one variable: a TileSet whose tile size is odd (15 px), so a cell centre falls on a half pixel
; (7.5). Godot sets a Control scene tile root to map_to_local + position and snaps that sum
; (tile_map_layer.cpp:1636, control.cpp:727-737), so the 10 px root draws at x 108, y 28. The other
; scene tile goldens use a 64 px grid, whose centres are whole pixels.

